      "created_at": "2012-05-02T20:22:48.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Know <span class=\"bbcode-i\">of</span>,  I’m thinking.    My guess is they hate each others guts.  Wraith is a genius who invents high-tech solutions to difficult problems.   Fixer is a martial arts master who also hits things with a wrench.   I don’t think they’d get along too well.</p>",
