      "username": "EvanDan55",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/evandan55/{size}/2374_2.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-02T20:26:12.000Z",
      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;awp832&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"awp832\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>Know <span class=\"bbcode-i\">of</span>,  I’m thinking.    My guess is they hate each others guts.  Wraith is a genius who invents high-tech solutions to difficult problems.   Fixer is a martial arts master who also hits things with a wrench.   I don’t think they’d get along too well.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Really? Just because they fight differently, doesn’t mean they don’t get along. I honestly think they’d be good friends, if Mr. Fixer wasn’t as much of a lone-star. They’re both fighting to protect Rook City, and like Singlog said, they’ve both suffered tragedies from violence in the city, so they probably understand each other. I’m not saying they fight together all the time (in the story, not necessarily gameplay), but they’ve probably got mutual respect.</p>",
