      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/a/a9a28c/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2012-05-02T20:34:05.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I dunno,  when I thought about it my mind went into the direction that RC was in trouble, so a young and budding new genius girl went to ask the old master for help.   Then he gave her the “I shall never fight again, violence is not the answer, young child”  routine and refused to help.  So Wraith (after a suitably epic fight with Spite that nearly cost her her life) would go find others willing to take action, thereby meeting up with the rest of the F5.</p>",
